OL,3,AUK diesel price hits #2 a litre as US
OL,4,Acalls for Europe to release more stocks
OL,5,
OL,6,FG7 leaders will attend a
OL,7,Fvideoconference on Friday to discuss
OL,8,Ffuel supplies after the US put pressure
OL,9,Fon European countries to release more
OL,10,Fof their diesel stocks.
